 ('switchplate-navigation','低い切替板のような行き先面と、離れた現在地欄を持つ。','${--wb-bg:#283c53;--wb-accent:#bdcfe0;--wb-line:#7f99b5;--wb-muted:#abc0d1}$ .wb-navigation-frame{background:#2c4560;border:3px solid #8098af;border-radius:4px;padding:6px}$ .wb-nav-desktop .wb-nav-list{gap:4px;background:#1e3550;padding:5px;border:1px solid #7893ae}$ .wb-nav-link,$ .wb-nav-disclosure{border:1px solid #8ca6bb;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(#5d7b99,#354f6c);padding:15px 10px;min-height:50px}$ .wb-nav-marker{display:none}$ .wb-nav-link[aria-current=page]{background:linear-gradient(#a5bdd0,#7a99b6);color:#1f3c56;box-shadow:inset 0 4px #506e8877}$ .wb-nav-foot{border:1px solid #7895b0;margin:8px 11px;padding:11px;background:#193349}'),
